      "id": 264798,
      "name": "Chief Lackey Rich",
      "username": "Chief_Lackey_Rich",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2026-01-11T04:52:26.337Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Really need to be careful about doomscrolling or you’ll wind up tilting at windmills for sure.  Amazing how rapidly this year has gone downhill so far.</p>\n<p>I note that this Harry person had nothing to say about the RPG kickstarter, which hasn’t gotten even a token update yet this year.  Christopher’s absence is even more ominous given that fact, although I suppose being a packing slave is the most reasonable explanation.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2026-01-11T04:52:26.337Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": 6,
